  "body": "fix todo in `src/vs/workbench/contrib/terminal/browser/terminalService.ts`:`TODO: Batch events`\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n- batch UI-triggering terminal instance events behind a microtask delay in terminal service\r\n- keep data and lifecycle events unbatched\r\n- remove the stale TODO by applying the intended debounce strategy\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n- eslint on changed file path (workspace lint script)\r\n- manual code review for event ordering and disposable lifecycle\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n- behavior for data stream and lifecycle listeners is unchanged",
  "rebaseable": false
 },
