   "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR updates the terminal service’s “any instance” event surface to batch several UI-triggering terminal instance events behind a microtask delay, aiming to reduce redundant UI re-renders during rapid event bursts.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Introduces microtask-based debouncing for several multiplexed “onAnyInstance…” terminal events (icon/title/status/dimensions/shell type).\n- Keeps data/input events unbatched while removing the prior “TODO: Batch events” note in favor of a concrete strategy.\n\n\n\n",
