     "date": "2026-03-24T06:09:09Z"
    },
    "message": "terminal: batch UI-triggering onAny* events with microtask debounce\n\nDebounce onAnyInstanceIconChange, onAnyInstanceMaximumDimensionsChange,\nonAnyInstancePrimaryStatusChange, onAnyInstanceTitleChange, and\nonAnyInstanceShellTypeChanged with MicrotaskDelay. These events drive\nUI refreshes (tab list, view, styles) and firing them individually per\ninstance causes redundant re-renders during bulk operations.\n\nData-streaming events (onAnyInstanceData, onAnyInstanceDataInput) and\nlifecycle events (onAnyInstanceProcessIdReady, onAnyInstanceSelectionChange,\nonAnyInstanceAddedCapabilityType) are left unbatched to preserve their\nreal-time semantics.",
    "tree": {
     "sha": "97e7bbc2cb4e07139520bc7394f15f4a6608d33f",
     "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode/git/trees/97e7bbc2cb4e07139520bc7394f15f4a6608d33f"
    },
